" :SongwriterTabChord (songwriter#tab#TabChord, spec [Tablature][[Annotations]]
" 6): write a chord above the tab, aligned to the cursor column, on its
" annotation line when it fits, else on a new one.

Given (insert chord above tab block at cursor column):
  e|-----------4--|--1-----------|
  B|--------1-----|-----2-----2--|
  G|--3-----0--0--|-----1--0--0--|
  D|--------1-----|-----1--------|
  A|--4--3--------|--1-----1-----|
  E|--3-----------|--1-----------|

Execute (insert chord above tab block at cursor column):
  call cursor(1, 14)
  call songwriter#tab#TabChord('Am7')
Then:
  AssertEqual '             Am7', getline(1)
  AssertEqual 'e|-----------4--|--1-----------|', getline(2)
  AssertEqual 'B|--------1-----|-----2-----2--|', getline(3)

Given (insert chord at column 1 (start of tab)):
  e|--4--|--1--|
  B|------|-----|
  G|------|-----|
  D|------|-----|
  A|------|-----|
  E|------|-----|

Execute (on the string name, the chord goes to the first column that keeps it an annotation):
  call cursor(1, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#TabChord('C')
Then:
  AssertEqual '  C', getline(1)
  AssertEqual 'e|--4--|--1--|', getline(2)

Given (insert chord in middle of tab block):
  e|--4--|--1--|
  B|------|-----|
  G|------|-----|
  D|------|-----|
  A|------|-----|
  E|------|-----|

Execute (insert chord in middle of tab block):
  call cursor(3, 8)
  call songwriter#tab#TabChord('Dm')
Then:
  AssertEqual '       Dm', getline(1)
  AssertEqual 'e|--4--|--1--|', getline(2)

Given (no-op on non-tab lines):
  this is prose

Execute (no-op on non-tab lines):
  call cursor(1, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#TabChord('Am')
Expect:
  this is prose

Given songwriter (a tab with an annotation line):
      Am
  e|--0--3--|

Execute (6 the chord goes on the annotation line right above the strings when it fits):
  call cursor(2, 8)
  SongwriterTabChord C
  AssertEqual [2, 8], [line('.'), col('.')]

Expect songwriter:
      Am C
  e|--0--3--|

Given songwriter (a tab with an annotation line):
      Am
  e|--0--3--|

Execute (6 the chord needs a space on each side, else it goes on a new line right above the strings):
  call cursor(2, 7)
  SongwriterTabChord C
  AssertEqual [3, 7], [line('.'), col('.')]

Expect songwriter:
      Am
        C
  e|--0--3--|
